1
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:13,856
Customers screen par aapke saare customers hain,
unke bakaaya ke saath.

2
00:00:13,896 --> 00:00:16,628
Upar naam ya mobile se khoj sakte hain.

3
00:00:17,383 --> 00:00:21,334
Naya customer jodne ke liye 'Add customer'
dabaaiye.

4
00:00:21,374 --> 00:00:25,401
Naam, mobile, aur business customer ho to uska
GSTIN.

5
00:00:25,441 --> 00:00:31,080
Credit limit tay karti hai ki customer adhiktam
kitna udhaar le sakta hai.

6
00:00:31,853 --> 00:00:36,693
WhatsApp par offers bhejne se pehle customer ki
anumati zaroori hai.

7
00:00:36,733 --> 00:00:39,994
Customer haan kahe, tabhi yeh box tick kijiye.

8
00:00:40,034 --> 00:00:44,946
Yeh consent record mein rehta hai aur kabhi bhi
hataaya ja sakta hai.

9
00:00:45,696 --> 00:00:50,967
Jin customers par udhaar baaki hai, unke aage
bakaaya rakam dikhti hai.

10
00:00:51,007 --> 00:00:54,707
Receive se payment lijiye, cash, UPI ya card
mein.

11
00:00:54,747 --> 00:00:57,999
Remind se WhatsApp par yaad dila sakte hain,

12
00:00:58,039 --> 00:01:02,113
aur Pay link se online payment ka link bhej
sakte hain.

13
00:01:02,889 --> 00:01:08,034
Rakesh ji ne apne udhaar mein se paanch sau
rupaye UPI se jama kiye.

14
00:01:08,074 --> 00:01:12,381
Receive dabaakar amount aur mode chuniye aur
save kijiye.

15
00:01:12,421 --> 00:01:15,050
Unka bakaaya turant ghat jaata hai.

16
00:01:15,798 --> 00:01:21,030
Customer ka poora hisaab 'Books & registers'
mein Customer statement par hai.

17
00:01:21,070 --> 00:01:26,164
Customer chuniye: shuruaati bakaaya, khaate mein
gaye har bill, har vasooli

18
00:01:26,204 --> 00:01:30,546
aur credit note, aur har line ke baad chaalu
bakaaya dikhta hai.

19
00:01:31,316 --> 00:01:36,245
Yeh statement CSV mein download karke ya print
karke customer ko de sakte hain,

20
00:01:36,285 --> 00:01:38,572
taaki hisaab mein koi uljhan na rahe.

21
00:01:44,622 --> 00:01:49,218
Medoro customers ko WhatsApp par bill aur
reminders bhej sakta hai.

22
00:01:49,258 --> 00:01:55,029
WhatsApp screen par aap apni pharmacy ka apna
WhatsApp number QR code se jodte hain,

23
00:01:55,069 --> 00:01:57,036
bilkul WhatsApp Web ki tarah.

24
00:01:57,803 --> 00:02:02,717
Is demo server par WhatsApp juda nahi hai, yahan
'Not linked' dikh raha hai.

25
00:02:02,757 --> 00:02:06,758
Isliye hum asli message bhejkar nahi dikha rahe,
sirf settings

26
00:02:06,798 --> 00:02:09,170
aur tracking screens dikha rahe hain.

27
00:02:09,912 --> 00:02:15,503
Invoice delivery mein 'Auto-send after sale'
chaalu karne par bill apne-aap jaata hai,

28
00:02:15,543 --> 00:02:19,235
par sirf un customers ko jinki WhatsApp consent
darj hai.

29
00:02:19,275 --> 00:02:23,164
'Attach the invoice PDF' se bill ka PDF bhi
saath jaata hai.

30
00:02:23,917 --> 00:02:28,528
Neeche Sent, Delivered, Read aur Failed ki ginti
aur delivery log hai,

31
00:02:28,568 --> 00:02:31,718
jahan har message ki delivery status dikhti hai.

32
00:02:32,500 --> 00:02:35,535
Customer messaging mein refill reminders hain,

33
00:02:35,575 --> 00:02:43,889
jo sirf is baat par chalte hain ki customer koi
dava kitne din mein dobara leta hai; Medoro
beemaari ka andaaza nahi lagaata.

34
00:02:43,929 --> 00:02:47,766
Saath mein feedback aur weekly payment reminders
bhi hain.

35
00:02:48,545 --> 00:02:52,898
Messages sirf unhi customers ko jaate hain
jinhone haan kaha hai.

36
00:02:52,938 --> 00:02:56,818
Customer STOP likhkar kabhi bhi opt-out kar
sakta hai, aur

37
00:02:56,858 --> 00:02:59,791
phir use koi promotional message nahi jaata.
